Technical Documentation Assistant

Create an application that can ingest technical documentation, retrieve relevant information, answer questions with citations, and identify when it doesn't have enough information to answer.

Use FastAPI, Docker, PostgreSQL/pgvector or Qdrant, and an LLM API.

